      <title>Healthcare Expenditure: স্বাস্থ্যখাতে সরকারি খরচ বেড়েছে তিনগুণ, কমেছে আমজনতার গ্যাঁটের খরচ</title>
      <link>https://tv9bangla.com/india/government-health-spending-triples-households-out-of-pocket-expenditure-share-falls-sharply-says-report-1361156.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://tv9bangla.com/india/government-health-spending-triples-households-out-of-pocket-expenditure-share-falls-sharply-says-report-1361156.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:10:25 +0530</pubDate>
